{"data": [{"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-08T16:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119467718373941588"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "On Sunday, NASA announced the opening of its $1 million Moon Base Student Challenge during a MAX POWER event at Kennedy Space Center Visitor Complex in", "display_url": "go.nasa.gov/3UBpcCs", "end": 94, "expanded_url": "https://go.nasa.gov/3UBpcCs", "start": 71, "status": 200, "title": "NASA Announces $1 Million to Students for Moon Base Challenge - NASA", "unwound_url": "https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-announces-1-million-to-students-for-moon-base-challenge/", "url": "https://t.co/VLc1ca1b2r"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/JuVrVdV70u", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2119467718373941588/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119467313539735553", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/JuVrVdV70u"}]}, "id": "2119467718373941588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 236, "impression_count": 620576, "like_count": 3169, "quote_count": 66, "reply_count": 256, "retweet_count": 519}, "text": "Just announced at MAX POWER: a $1 million Moon Base Student Challenge! https://t.co/VLc1ca1b2r\n\nThe competition tasks U.S. high school and post-secondary student teams to develop solutions to real-world engineering constraints for establishing a long-term human presence on the https://t.co/JuVrVdV70u", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2119467718373941588"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-08T14:47:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119441731846639971"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 93, "id": "16580226", "start": 81, "username": "NASAKennedy"}, {"end": 110, "id": "1250199053310230530", "start": 99, "username": "airdotshow"}, {"end": 192, "id": "2064057754952572928", "start": 180, "username": "capeweek_us"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cIP3QQzNgR", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2119441731846639971/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119441256052932608", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/cIP3QQzNgR"}]}, "id": "2119441731846639971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 114, "impression_count": 653647, "like_count": 2595, "quote_count": 32, "reply_count": 129, "retweet_count": 373}, "text": "American ambition at full throttle. 🇺🇸\n\nAn  incredible first day of MAX POWER at @NASAKennedy with @airdotshow, and  we’re not done yet. This is just a taste of what’s ahead with  @capeweek_us.\n\nMore power. More inspiration. Let’s go! https://t.co/cIP3QQzNgR", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2119441731846639971"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:25:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119239880920510952"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The upcoming mission for SpaceX's Starship program will see the com...", "display_url": "youtu.be/wj5GE768sCk", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/wj5GE768sCk", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119239884393402368/SsAA9Gpl?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119239884393402368/SsAA9Gpl?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 241, "status": 200, "title": "SpaceX is finally ready to catch a Starship", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wj5GE768sCk&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/ZyOtRwzNY2"}]}, "id": "2119239880920510952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 12748, "like_count": 78, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "SpaceX says it's finally ready to attempt a tower catch of its Starship upper stage. In our latest report, we take a look at what that means for the upcoming mission (no earlier than Nov. 13) and what it means if they're successful.\n\nWatch: https://t.co/ZyOtRwzNY2", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2119239880920510952"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-08T00:09:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119220814029771159"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sensanders/sta…", "end": 37, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sensanders/status/2119133406978253013", "start": 14, "url": "https://t.co/TXkNG79VRd"}]}, "id": "2119220814029771159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 11602, "like_count": 207, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119133406978253013", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "lolololololol https://t.co/TXkNG79VRd", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119220814029771159"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-08T00:01:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119218624556675503"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/bendreyfuss/st…", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/bendreyfuss/status/2119206129117151484", "start": 120, "url": "https://t.co/SURp7X0TQg"}]}, "id": "2119218624556675503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2057, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119206129117151484", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A proposal Fallon 53-47 is not in fact proof that confidence in its failure was warranted!\n\nQuite the opposite in fact! https://t.co/SURp7X0TQg", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119218624556675503"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:49:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119215715492438444"], "id": "2119215715492438444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4371, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The CIA has never tried to recruit me, but if some agent came to me and was like “we need you to tweet this one weird thing” honestly I would do it, the issue is I would be so psyched about the CIA asking me to do something I would completely spill the beans on the whole op", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119215715492438444"}, {"author_id": "626660